                Is the Farmer App free to download?
              </button>
            </h2>
            <div id="fq1" class="accordion-collapse collapse" data-bs-parent="#faqFarmer">
              <div class="accordion-body">
                Yes, you can download the Farmer App for free on Google Play and App Store. Enjoy a 14-day free trial with complete features.
              </div>
            </div>
          </div>
          <div class="accordion-item">
            <h2 class="accordion-header">
              <button class="accordion-button collapsed" type="button" data-bs-toggle="collapse" data-bs-target="#fq2">
                Is the Farmer App available in Hindi?
              </button>
            </h2>
            <div id="fq2" class="accordion-collapse collapse" data-bs-parent="#faqFarmer">
              <div class="accordion-body">
               Yes, our Farmer App is packed with the merits of offering convenience in Hindi and English, both. You can switch languages at any time from the settings in the menu. The app is created with ease in mind for every bovin farmer in the country, whether they reside in a city or a village. 
              </div>
            </div>
          </div>
          <div class="accordion-item">
            <h2 class="accordion-header">
              <button class="accordion-button collapsed" type="button" data-bs-toggle="collapse" data-bs-target="#fq3">
                Does the Farmer App work without internet?
              </button>
            </h2>
            <div id="fq3" class="accordion-collapse collapse" data-bs-parent="#faqFarmer">
              <div class="accordion-body">
                Absolutely. The farmer app works and runs smoothly online and offline. Even without an internet connection, you can record milk, manage cattle, and track payments. 
              </div>
            </div>
          </div>
          <div class="accordion-item">
            <h2 class="accordion-header">
              <button class="accordion-button collapsed" type="button" data-bs-toggle="collapse" data-bs-target="#fq4">
                How are payments processed through the Farmer App?
              </button>
            </h2>
            <div id="fq4" class="accordion-collapse collapse" data-bs-parent="#faqFarmer">
              <div class="accordion-body">
                Through the Farmer App, payments are auto-calculated on the basis of milk quantity and fat percentage. You can directly make UPI transfers to farmers from within the app, or download payment reports to process things manually. All payment history is stored in digital form.
              </div>
            </div>
          </div>
          <div class="accordion-item">
            <h2 class="accordion-header">
